  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "How to run",
      "items": [
        "cargo run --release -- [--gamma 0.01] [--lmin 4] [--lmax 8] [--init minus-x|random]",
        "cargo run --release --bin trajectories -- [--trajectories 1000] [--seed 1]",
        "cargo run --release --bin disorder -- [--thetas 0,0.125,0.25,0.375,0.5]",
        "cargo run --release --bin probes -- [--gamma 0.01 | --gammas 0.002,0.01 --tag name]",
        "Then: plot_evolution.py, fit_decay.py, compare_initial_states.py, compare_methods.py, plot_disorder.py, fit_probes.py, plot_gamma_scan.py (all read and write data/)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Previous coefficients",
      "items": [
        "These laptop runs (13-14 October 2026) used h = 0.5, a = (0.73, 0.41, 0.29), b = (0.58, -0.37, 0.66), c_xz = 0.31, c_zy = -0.44, c_yx = 0.27 (CLAUDE.md, Hamiltonian baseline)",
        "parameters.rs now holds the current coefficients: rerunning these binaries does not reproduce the appendix data",
        "Rates are A0 e^(-Gamma t) window fits, not the 1/e rates of the main text",
        "The appendix figures rates_vs_L_*.png are redrawn by plot_rates_vs_L.py from the current runs (states_rates.csv); spectrum.png comes from ed (spectra case)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Key mechanics",
      "items": [
        "main.rs and disorder share Liouvillian + Propagator: translation orbits for the uniform baseline, full 4^L Pauli basis for random c",
        "trajectories: real-noise diffusive unravelling, trajectories in parallel, mean, standard error and one-trajectory spread per time",
        "disorder and probes draw the same random-c realization (generator 1000 seed + L)",
        "probes evolve operators forward with the Lindbladian and form autocorrelations Tr[e^(Lt)(A) B]",
        "fit_decay.py and fit_probes.py also write decay_fit.png and probe_*.png to data/; the notes now use the redrawn rates_vs_L figures instead"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Notes part",
      "items": [
        "Compile: latex/build_parts.sh previous_coefficients -> latex/parts/pdf/previous_coefficients.pdf (full notes are built first; numbering as in latex/notes.tex)",
        "Sections: 1 Model; How the decay rates are computed; Appendix A Earlier results with the previous coefficients (L <= 10)",
        "Appendix subsections: Scar oscillations and their decay; Scar versus non-scar probes; Liouvillian spectrum; Dependence on gamma at fixed L = 6"
      ]
    }
  ]
